{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/872309-questions-about-the-text-only-pdfs","id":872309,"title":"Questions about the Text only pdfs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-23T06:04:23-07:00","id":872309,"title":"Questions about the Text only pdfs","content":"I'm only now beginning to go through this and wonder if there is a place where typos were spotted. In the very first page I spotted a few and didn't want to repeat. <br /> also, some of the writing is vague. <br /> &quot;. If the Masked changeling prevails, she remains hidden, except for one detail: her shadow. A changeling\u2019s <br /> shadow always betrays her true fae shape, even when the Mask is at its full power.&quot; Question: Does that mean humans see this shadow? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T14:30:27-07:00","id":872640,"title":"","content":"This is the rough edition of the drafts we've been given where text is still being debated, errata rewritten and bonuses and penalties debated for balancing purposes. It's also innevitable that errors filter through, such as bits of text being the wrong font, size or not being bolded. Vague language is also a part of this.<br /> <br /> In the case of language that's either vague or incomplete, try houseruling it to see if that fixes things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T17:32:54-07:00","id":872765,"title":"","content":"Don't bother noting typos, they'll be fixed internally, or in the final round of errata if they make it that far. The point of the previews is to give feedback on how it plays.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}